            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action+Lie+algebroid"} action Lie algebroid
          %p
            Here we introduce the required
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+Lie+theory"} higher Lie theory
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+%E2%88%9E-algebroids"} Lie ∞-algebroids
            (def.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LInfinityAlgebroid"}
            below). Further
            %a{:href => "#BRSTComplex"} below
            we specify this to actions by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal+gauge+symmetries"} infinitesimal gauge symmetries
            to obtain the
            %em
